<title>HONG KONG: Carr Indosuez sets warrants on SHK Prop.</title>
<headline>Carr Indosuez sets warrants on SHK Prop.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carr Indosuez Asia (Derivatives) Ltd said it issued on Thursday 30 million American-style call warrants on Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$77.85	 PREMIUM	 9.63 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$1.698	 GEARING	 5.09X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	10.OCT.97	PAYDATE	 22.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$86.50	 LISTING DATE  24.OCT.96</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
